%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

% A program talks to its device as well as drawing on paper. What it
% prints appears in the device output below the page, and an error
% ends the job with a report, the way a printer would answer it.

(Asking the device about itself:) =
(  product         ) print product =
(  version         ) print version =
(  language level  ) print languagelevel =

(\nThe operand stack after 3 4 add 5 mul 2 sqrt:) =
3 4 add 5 mul 2 sqrt
pstack clear

/Helvetica findfont 28 scalefont setfont
72 700 moveto (This page is drawn first.) show
showpage

(\nNow a mistake: the next line asks for a name nobody defined.) =
72 650 moveto (It never gets this far.) shw
showpage
